  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelArmorPowerQuasarBase">
    <defName>BOR_Quasar_Apparel_PowerArmor</defName>
    <label>kwazaari marine armor</label>
    <description>A suit of Powered Armor made from Quasar Alloy. Armor of this caliber in military use is often on strict lend-lease as the inevitable god-complex one acquires while wearing it is considered 'problematic' and/or 'extremely annoying' by most Kwazaari Quartermasters.</description>
    <apparel>
